  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2DegreesC Crowdsourced Climate Data Sensor Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports our mission to deploy climate sensors in remote areas that are presently underserved by the existing network of climate observations. The lack of detailed data about the weather and environment in these areas prevents us from fully understanding the impact of climate change on these communities, including the biodiversity that call these areas home. Or purpose with partners is to distribute sensors globally in remote areas on land, and using our UNESCO project in the ocean.</narrative>
  </description>
